pc:
A: All S is P (ro)
E:  No S is P (no -- if that is still the word)
I:   Some S is P (su'o)
O: Some S is not P (xu'o?)
A and O are contradictories, as are E and I; the other relations among
these depend upon
what we do with existential import (Does A imply I or E O?)

